###
### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

###
### Auth - login usuário local (JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

###
### Auth - bootstrap inicial (somente ambiente novo, 1a execução)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/bootstrap-admin
X-Bootstrap-Token: {{bootstrapToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantNome": "{{tenantNome}}",
  "empresaRazaoSocial": "{{empresaRazaoSocial}}",
  "empresaCnpj": "{{empresaCnpj}}",
  "nome": "Admin TechBr",
  "email": "admin@techbr.com",
  "password": "Password@12"
}

###
### Auth - usuário autenticado (JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Observação de RBAC (fase atual)
### - Upload ZIP: ADMIN/OPERADOR (com escopo tenant/empresa).
### - Consultas /imports e /documents: ADMIN/OPERADOR/LEITOR (com escopo tenant/empresa).
### - ADMIN global pode operar sem vínculo explícito em app_user_empresa.

###
### Upload ZIP (rota principal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/upload?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="nfe.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./docs/nfe.zip
--UploadBoundary--

###
### Upload ZIP (alias legado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/importacoes/upload?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="nfe.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./docs/nfe.zip
--UploadBoundary--

###
### Manifest (rota principal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "{{tenantId}}/{{empresaId}}/9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869.xml",
      "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
      "sizeBytes": 1500,
      "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Manifest (alias legado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/importacoes/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "{{tenantId}}/{{empresaId}}/nfe-001.xml",
      "sha256": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "sizeBytes": 14320,
      "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Importação por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Listar importações (paginado + filtro opcional por status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&page=0&size=20&status=CONCLUIDO
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Itens da importação (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/items?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}


### Itens da importação (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/234/items?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Itens da importação por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/items?status=PARSEADO&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Resumo de falhas (agrupado por erro_codigo + erro_mensagem)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/failures-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Reprocessar itens com falha (ex.: após ajuste de parser/regra)
### statuses permitidos: FALHA_PARSE, FALHA_PERMANENTE, ERRO
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{importacaoId}}/reprocess
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statuses": ["FALHA_PARSE"],
  "erroCodigo": "FALHA_PARSE",
  "limit": 500,
  "dryRun": false
}

###
### Documento por chave de acesso
### Retorna também estado atual da nota:
### - statusDocumento (ATIVA/CANCELADA)
### - cancelledAt, cancelProtocol, cancelReason (quando houver evento de cancelamento aplicado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{accessKey}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Listagem de documentos (viewer avançado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&page=0&size=20&sort=issueDate,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Listagem de documentos com filtros principais
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&model=65&operationType=S&statusDocumento=ATIVA&issueDateFrom=2024-02-01&issueDateTo=2024-02-28&page=0&size=20&sort=totalAmount,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Download XML original por accessKey
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{accessKey}}/xml?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Timeline de eventos da nota
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{accessKey}}/events?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Resumo financeiro do período
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/summary?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&issueDateFrom=2026-03-01&issueDateTo=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Exportar documentos (CSV)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/export
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "model": 55,
  "operationType": "S",
  "issueDateFrom": "2026-03-01",
  "issueDateTo": "2026-03-31",
  "format": "CSV"
}

###
### Exportar documentos (PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/export
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "issueDateFrom": "2026-03-01",
  "issueDateTo": "2026-03-31",
  "format": "PDF"
}

###
### Emitentes distintos (autocomplete de filtro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/emitters?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&q=TECH&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Destinatários distintos (autocomplete de filtro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/receivers?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&q=SHOP&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Estatísticas por CFOP (top N)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/stats/cfop?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&issueDateFrom=2024-03-31&issueDateTo=2024-03-31&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?tenantId=1&empresaId=2&issueDateFrom=2024-02-01&issueDateTo=2024-02-28&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
###
### Estatísticas por NCM (top N)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/stats/ncm?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&issueDateFrom=2024-02-01&issueDateTo=2026-03-31&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Cobertura de documentos (resumo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/coverage?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Cobertura de documentos (backfill controlado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/coverage/backfill?tenantId={{tenantId}}&empresaId={{empresaId}}&limit=500
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Cenário de erro 422 (objectKey inexistente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/manifest
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "empresaId": {{empresaId}},
  "entries": [
    {
      "objectKey": "{{tenantId}}/{{empresaId}}/nao-existe.xml",
      "sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"
    }
  ]
}

###
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### SEGURANÇA AGENT (fase 1)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

###
### Agent Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/session
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: {{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### Agent Heartbeat (presença operacional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: {{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentVersion": "1.0.0",
  "hostname": "desktop-agent-01",
  "uploadsInFlight": 2,
  "pendingFiles": 48,
  "errorCountWindow": 0
}

###
### Agent Session - repetir em burst para validar 429 + Retry-After
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/session
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### Agent Upload URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{agentApiKey}}
X-Agent-Id: {{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sha256": "9f81409800c24998f96a4f8e2e1bab1dfe93144563fcb2c3b946b5461ad15869",
  "originalFileName": "nfe-001.xml",
  "sizeBytes": 1500
}

