###
### Admin - criar Agent API Key (requer JWT ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Servidor principal de XML"
}

###
### Admin - listar Agent API Keys (requer JWT ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - monitor de agentes (presença por tenant/empresa)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agents?tenantId={{tenantId}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - monitor de agentes filtrando por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agents?tenantId={{tenantId}}&status=ONLINE&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - resumo de presença de agentes (cards do front)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agents/summary?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - detalhe de um agente específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agents/{{agentId}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - revogar Agent API Key (requer JWT ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys/{{agentKeyId}}?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - rotacionar Agent API Key sem downtime (requer JWT ADMIN)
### `revokeOld=false` mantém a chave antiga ativa durante transição do agente
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/empresas/{{empresaAdminId}}/agent-keys/{{agentKeyId}}/rotate?tenantId={{tenantId}}&revokeOld=false
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "rotacao sem downtime",
  "criadoPor": "admin"
}

###
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### IDENTIDADE (Tenant / Empresa / Usuário local)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### Observação:
### - rotas /admin/** requerem JWT de usuário com role ADMIN.

###
### Admin - criar tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "{{tenantNome}}"
}

###
### Admin - listar tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - listar tenants por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants?status=ATIVO
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - detalhar tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - inativar tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INATIVO"
}

###
### Admin - reativar tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ATIVO"
}

###
### Admin - criar empresa dentro do tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "{{empresaCnpj}}",
  "razaoSocial": "{{empresaRazaoSocial}}"
}

###
### Admin - listar empresas do tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - listar empresas ativas do tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas?status=ATIVA
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - detalhar empresa do tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - inativar empresa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INATIVA"
}

###
### Admin - reativar empresa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ATIVA"
}

###
### Admin - criar usuário local
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Operador Homolog",
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

###
### Admin - listar usuários locais
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - listar usuários ativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?status=ATIVO
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - detalhar usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - inativar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INATIVO"
}

###
### Admin - reativar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ATIVO"
}

###
### Admin - adicionar role ao usuário (ADMIN / OPERADOR / LEITOR)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles/OPERADOR
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - remover role do usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles/OPERADOR
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - vincular usuário à empresa (escopo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

###
### Admin - remover vínculo usuário ↔ empresa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/empresas/{{empresaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
